-- Tests for the Liberty personal accident rules, UW-PAG-W-001-10-V.
-- Every expected value was worked out by hand from the SOURCE (the figure, the period or the
-- rule it rests on is named beside each group) before the assertion was run. None was copied
-- from an evaluation. A failing assertion is a finding about the source or the encoding,
-- never a value to edit. Where a value rests on a fork, the fork is named (NOTES.md section 3).
--
-- Scenario figures that the wording leaves to the schedule (limits of 1.000.000.000 đồng, a
-- daily sum of 500.000, a medical limit of 50.000.000, a hospital allowance of 400.000) are
-- HYPOTHETICAL inputs chosen to make the arithmetic visible; they are not in the source.

§ `Tests`

§§ `Fixtures`

GIVEN `the date of birth` IS A DATE
      `the place`         IS A `A place in the group`
      `left-handedness`   IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An insured person`
`a citizen born on` `the date of birth` `, placed as` `the place` `, left-handed:` `left-handedness` MEANS
    `An insured person` WITH
        `date of birth`                                                         IS `the date of birth`
        `place in the group`                                                    IS `the place`
        `a Vietnamese citizen`                                                  IS TRUE
        `living in Vietnam when cover began, as declared in the application`    IS TRUE
        `living in Vietnam on a tourist visa`                                   IS FALSE
        `a citizen of a country under United Nations, United States, European Union or United Kingdom sanctions` IS FALSE
        `occupation class`                                                      IS `class 1`
        `left-handed`                                                           IS `left-handedness`
        `degree of permanent disability before the effective date`              IS 0
        `insured under the same contract as a parent, adoptive parent or legal guardian` IS FALSE
        `in full-time study, with a valid student card or proof of it`          IS FALSE
        `keeps a valid visa or temporary residence card`                        IS TRUE

`Lan` MEANS `a citizen born on` (YMD 1990 5 15) `, placed as` `an employee of the employer` `, left-handed:` (JUST FALSE)

GIVEN `the date of birth` IS A DATE
      `in study`          IS A BOOLEAN
      `with a parent`     IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An insured person`
`a child born on` `the date of birth` `, in full-time study:` `in study` `, with a parent:` `with a parent` MEANS
    `An insured person` WITH
        `date of birth`                                                         IS `the date of birth`
        `place in the group`                                                    IS `a dependant` `an unmarried child the insured member has a duty to support`
        `a Vietnamese citizen`                                                  IS TRUE
        `living in Vietnam when cover began, as declared in the application`    IS TRUE
        `living in Vietnam on a tourist visa`                                   IS FALSE
        `a citizen of a country under United Nations, United States, European Union or United Kingdom sanctions` IS FALSE
        `occupation class`                                                      IS `class 1`
        `left-handed`                                                           IS NOTHING
        `degree of permanent disability before the effective date`              IS 0
        `insured under the same contract as a parent, adoptive parent or legal guardian` IS `with a parent`
        `in full-time study, with a valid student card or proof of it`          IS `in study`
        `keeps a valid visa or temporary residence card`                        IS TRUE

GIVEN `on a tourist visa` IS A BOOLEAN
      `with a visa`       IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An insured person`
`a foreign employee, on a tourist visa:` `on a tourist visa` `, keeping a valid visa:` `with a visa` MEANS
    `An insured person` WITH
        `date of birth`                                                         IS YMD 1985 1 1
        `place in the group`                                                    IS `an employee of the employer`
        `a Vietnamese citizen`                                                  IS FALSE
        `living in Vietnam when cover began, as declared in the application`    IS TRUE
        `living in Vietnam on a tourist visa`                                   IS `on a tourist visa`
        `a citizen of a country under United Nations, United States, European Union or United Kingdom sanctions` IS FALSE
        `occupation class`                                                      IS `class 2`
        `left-handed`                                                           IS JUST FALSE
        `degree of permanent disability before the effective date`              IS 0
        `insured under the same contract as a parent, adoptive parent or legal guardian` IS FALSE
        `in full-time study, with a valid student card or proof of it`          IS FALSE
        `keeps a valid visa or temporary residence card`                        IS `with a visa`

GIVEN `the degree` IS A NUMBER
      `the class`  IS AN `An occupation class`
      `sanctions`  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An insured person`
`an employee with earlier disability` `the degree` `, in` `the class` `, under sanctions:` `sanctions` MEANS
    `An insured person` WITH
        `date of birth`                                                         IS YMD 1980 1 1
        `place in the group`                                                    IS `an employee of the employer`
        `a Vietnamese citizen`                                                  IS TRUE
        `living in Vietnam when cover began, as declared in the application`    IS TRUE
        `living in Vietnam on a tourist visa`                                   IS FALSE
        `a citizen of a country under United Nations, United States, European Union or United Kingdom sanctions` IS `sanctions`
        `occupation class`                                                      IS `the class`
        `left-handed`                                                           IS JUST FALSE
        `degree of permanent disability before the effective date`              IS `the degree`
        `insured under the same contract as a parent, adoptive parent or legal guardian` IS FALSE
        `in full-time study, with a valid student card or proof of it`          IS FALSE
