GIVETH A `The policy schedule`
`a 2026 schedule with death limit` `the death limit` `, injury limit` `the injury limit` `, medical limit` `the medical limit` `, temporary basis` `the basis` `, renewal:` `a renewal` `, worldwide:` `worldwide` `, food poisoning:` `food poisoning` MEANS
    `The policy schedule` WITH
        `first day of the period of insurance`  IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `last day of the period of insurance`   IS YMD 2026 12 31
        `a renewal`                             IS `a renewal`
        `worldwide geographical scope`          IS `worldwide`
        `death limit`                           IS `the death limit`
        `permanent injury limit`                IS `the injury limit`
        `temporary injury benefit`              IS JUST (`The temporary injury benefit chosen` WITH
                                                            `basis`                        IS `the basis`
                                                            `limit`                        IS 30000000
                                                            `maximum days for each injury` IS 60
                                                            `maximum days in the period`   IS 90)
        `medical expense limit`                 IS `the medical limit`
        `daily hospital allowance`              IS JUST 400000
        `food poisoning cover agreed`           IS `food poisoning`

`the 2026 schedule` MEANS
    `a 2026 schedule with death limit` (JUST 1000000000) `, injury limit` (JUST 1000000000) `, medical limit` (JUST 50000000) `, temporary basis` (`a fixed sum for each day` 500000) `, renewal:` FALSE `, worldwide:` FALSE `, food poisoning:` FALSE

`the 2026 renewal schedule` MEANS
    `a 2026 schedule with death limit` (JUST 1000000000) `, injury limit` (JUST 1000000000) `, medical limit` (JUST 50000000) `, temporary basis` (`a fixed sum for each day` 500000) `, renewal:` TRUE `, worldwide:` TRUE `, food poisoning:` TRUE

`the 2026 income-based schedule` MEANS
    `a 2026 schedule with death limit` (JUST 1000000000) `, injury limit` (JUST 1000000000) `, medical limit` (JUST 50000000) `, temporary basis` `the insured's monthly income` `, renewal:` FALSE `, worldwide:` FALSE `, food poisoning:` FALSE

`the 2026 schedule without benefit A` MEANS
    `a 2026 schedule with death limit` NOTHING `, injury limit` NOTHING `, medical limit` (JUST 50000000) `, temporary basis` (`a fixed sum for each day` 500000) `, renewal:` FALSE `, worldwide:` FALSE `, food poisoning:` FALSE

`the 2026 schedule with small A limits and a large medical limit` MEANS
    `a 2026 schedule with death limit` (JUST 100000000) `, injury limit` (JUST 100000000) `, medical limit` (JUST 200000000) `, temporary basis` (`a fixed sum for each day` 500000) `, renewal:` FALSE `, worldwide:` FALSE `, food poisoning:` FALSE

GIVEN `employment ended`  IS A MAYBE DATE
      `premium paid`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `absences`          IS A LIST OF `An absence from Vietnam`
      `changes`           IS A LIST OF `A change increasing the risk`
GIVETH A `The insured's cover facts`
`cover facts with employment ending` `employment ended` `, premium paid:` `premium paid` `, absences` `absences` `, changes` `changes` MEANS
    `The insured's cover facts` WITH
        `date of entry into Vietnam, if after the first day of the period`      IS NOTHING
        `date the insured became eligible, if after the first day of the period` IS NOTHING
        `date the insured ceased to be eligible, for a reason other than age`   IS NOTHING
        `date the group contract ended`                                         IS NOTHING
        `date employment with the employer ended`                               IS `employment ended`
        `date membership of the sponsoring organisation ended`                  IS NOTHING
        `date the insured member's own cover ended`                             IS NOTHING
        `date the benefits were used up`                                        IS NOTHING
        `premium for the insured paid in full within the payment period`        IS `premium paid`
        `last day of the payment period`                                        IS YMD 2026 1 31
        `absences from Vietnam`                                                 IS `absences`
        `changes increasing the risk`                                           IS `changes`

`no change to cover` MEANS `cover facts with employment ending` NOTHING `, premium paid:` TRUE `, absences` EMPTY `, changes` EMPTY

GIVEN `entry`      IS A MAYBE DATE
      `eligible`   IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `The insured's cover facts`
`cover facts with entry into Vietnam on` `entry` `and eligibility from` `eligible` MEANS
    `The insured's cover facts` WITH
        `date of entry into Vietnam, if after the first day of the period`      IS `entry`
        `date the insured became eligible, if after the first day of the period` IS `eligible`
        `date the insured ceased to be eligible, for a reason other than age`   IS NOTHING
        `date the group contract ended`                                         IS NOTHING
        `date employment with the employer ended`                               IS NOTHING
        `date membership of the sponsoring organisation ended`                  IS NOTHING
        `date the insured member's own cover ended`                             IS NOTHING
        `date the benefits were used up`                                        IS NOTHING
        `premium for the insured paid in full within the payment period`        IS TRUE
        `last day of the payment period`                                        IS YMD 2026 1 31
        `absences from Vietnam`                                                 IS EMPTY
        `changes increasing the risk`                                           IS EMPTY

GIVEN `the day`            IS A DATE
      `the sole cause`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `the circumstances`  IS A LIST OF `A circumstance of the accident`
GIVETH AN `An accident`
`an accident on` `the day` `, the sole cause:` `the sole cause` `, in` `the circumstances` MEANS
    `An accident` WITH
        `date of the accident`                                                 IS `the day`
        `sudden`                                                               IS TRUE
        `caused by an external and visible force on the insured's body`        IS TRUE
        `caused harm to the insured's body`                                    IS TRUE
        `unintended by the insured and beyond the insured's control`           IS TRUE
        `the direct and sole cause of the injury or death`                     IS `the sole cause`
        `the injury came from illness, gradual mental or physical wear, deterioration of health, age, disability or degeneration` IS FALSE
        `within the geographical area in the schedule`                         IS TRUE
        `circumstances`                                                        IS `the circumstances`

`a fall at work on 10 March 2026` MEANS `an accident on` (YMD 2026 3 10) `, the sole cause:` TRUE `, in` (LIST `performing work`)

GIVEN `the kind`     IS A `A kind of medical expense`
      `the amount`   IS A NUMBER
      `the customary amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`      IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A medical expense`
`a bill for` `the kind` `of` `the amount` `, customary` `the customary amount` `, on` `the day` MEANS
    `A medical expense` WITH
        `kind`                                                      IS `the kind`
        `amount paid by the insured`                                IS `the amount`
        `the reasonable and customary amount`                       IS `the customary amount`
        `date incurred`                                             IS `the day`
        `to treat the injury from the accident`                     IS TRUE
        `directed by a Doctor`                                      IS TRUE
        `for professional services of a Doctor at a Medical Facility` IS TRUE
        `a pandemic declaration in force on the date incurred`      IS FALSE

GIVEN `the bills`           IS A LIST OF `A medical expense`
      `met elsewhere`       IS A NUMBER
      `paid already`        IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The medical expense claim`
`a medical claim for` `the bills` `, met elsewhere` `met elsewhere` `, paid already` `paid already` MEANS
    `The medical expense claim` WITH
        `expenses`                                                  IS `the bills`
        `also insured under another contract, other than social insurance` IS FALSE
        `amount met by another contract or another source`          IS `met elsewhere`
        `amount already paid under benefit C in the period`         IS `paid already`

`the bills after the fall` MEANS
    LIST `a bill for` `surgery` `of` 20000000 `, customary` 18000000 `, on` (YMD 2026 3 15)
       , `a bill for` `dental surgery` `of` 5000000 `, customary` 5000000 `, on` (YMD 2026 3 20)

GIVEN `first` IS A DATE
      `last`  IS A DATE
      `determined` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `days paid` IS A NUMBER
      `amount paid` IS A NUMBER
      `income` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `receiving income` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The temporary injury claim`
`a temporary injury from` `first` `to` `last` `, determined` `determined` `, days paid` `days paid` `, amount paid` `amount paid` `, income` `income` `, receiving income:` `receiving income` MEANS
    `The temporary injury claim` WITH
        `first day of total disablement`                                    IS `first`
        `last day of total disablement`                                     IS `last`
        `still receiving income, wages or business income`                  IS `receiving income`
        `monthly income at the time of the accident`                        IS `income`
        `date death or permanent injury was determined for payment`         IS `determined`
        `days already paid in the period for other injuries`                IS `days paid`
        `amount already paid under benefit B in the period`                 IS `amount paid`
        `also insured under another contract, other than social insurance`  IS FALSE

`twenty days off work` MEANS
    `a temporary injury from` (YMD 2026 2 1) `to` (YMD 2026 2 20) `, determined` NOTHING `, days paid` 0 `, amount paid` 0 `, income` NOTHING `, receiving income:` FALSE

GIVEN `admitted`  IS A DATE
      `the hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The hospital allowance claim`
`a hospital stay from` `admitted` `of` `the hours` `hours` MEANS
    `The hospital allowance claim` WITH
        `date of admission`                                         IS `admitted`
        `hospital treatment was required for the injury`            IS TRUE
        `hours of treatment in a Medical Facility`                  IS `the hours`
        `also insured under another contract, other than social insurance` IS FALSE

GIVEN `the assessment` IS A DATE
      `the items`      IS A LIST OF `A claimed permanent injury`
GIVETH A `The permanent injury claim`
`an assessment on` `the assessment` `of` `the items` MEANS
    `The permanent injury claim` WITH
        `date of the assessment`                                             IS `the assessment`
        `the injury lasted continuously from the accident to the assessment` IS TRUE
        `no hope of recovery at the assessment`                              IS TRUE
        `items`                                                              IS `the items`

GIVEN i IS A `A permanent injury`
GIVETH A `A claimed permanent injury`
`claimed:` i MEANS `A claimed permanent injury` WITH
    `the injury`                                                            IS i
    `within another claimed item with a larger amount, for the same injury` IS FALSE

GIVEN i IS A `A permanent injury`
GIVETH A `A claimed permanent injury`
`claimed, within a larger item:` i MEANS `A claimed permanent injury` WITH
    `the injury`                                                            IS i
    `within another claimed item with a larger amount, for the same injury` IS TRUE

`the clean claim facts` MEANS `The claim facts` WITH
    `all statements and declarations in the application complete, true and accurate` IS TRUE
    `the claim is false or fraudulent`                                              IS FALSE
    `the claim arises from a change the Company was not told of, or did not agree to cover` IS FALSE
    `a beneficiary was designated`                                                  IS FALSE

GIVEN `notice`    IS A MAYBE DATE
      `forms`     IS A MAYBE DATE
      `file`      IS A MAYBE DATE
      `documents` IS A LIST OF `A claim document`
GIVETH A `The claim procedure`
`a procedure with notice` `notice` `, forms` `forms` `, file` `file` `, documents` `documents` MEANS
    `The claim procedure` WITH
        `date written notice of the injury was given`                    IS `notice`
        `date the claim forms and supporting evidence were returned`     IS `forms`
        `date the claim file was submitted`                              IS `file`
        `documents supplied`                                             IS `documents`
        `originals supplied, or copies the Company accepted`             IS TRUE
        `the insured used the services the treating Doctor directed and had the treatment the Doctor considered medically necessary` IS TRUE

`every claim document` MEANS
    LIST `the claim form, completed on the Company's form, signed by the claimant and signed and stamped by the policyholder`
       , `the accident report`
       , `the injury certificate`
       , `the death certificate`
       , `the certificate of lawful inheritance`
       , `the treating Doctor's direction to rest, or the social insurance sick-leave certificate`
       , `the medical treatment records`
       , `the timesheet and the labour contract or agreement`

