§§ `The permanent injury tables: bands, sets and notes (src 359-467)`

-- Teeth (src 371-374): >8 not replaceable 30%; 5-7 15%; 3-4 8%; 1-3 3%. 3 teeth: fork F7.
#ASSERT `the row for the loss of` 1 `teeth, replaceable by dentures:` TRUE EQUALS JUST `loss of 1 to 3 teeth`
#ASSERT `the row for the loss of` 2 `teeth, replaceable by dentures:` TRUE EQUALS JUST `loss of 1 to 3 teeth`
#ASSERT `the row for the loss of` 3 `teeth, replaceable by dentures:` TRUE EQUALS JUST `loss of 3 to 4 teeth`
#ASSERT `the row for the loss of` 4 `teeth, replaceable by dentures:` TRUE EQUALS JUST `loss of 3 to 4 teeth`
#ASSERT `the row for the loss of` 5 `teeth, replaceable by dentures:` TRUE EQUALS JUST `loss of 5 to 7 teeth`
#ASSERT `the row for the loss of` 7 `teeth, replaceable by dentures:` FALSE EQUALS JUST `loss of 5 to 7 teeth`
#ASSERT `the row for the loss of` 8 `teeth, replaceable by dentures:` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the row for the loss of` 9 `teeth, replaceable by dentures:` FALSE EQUALS JUST `loss of more than 8 teeth that cannot be replaced by dentures`
#ASSERT `the row for the loss of` 9 `teeth, replaceable by dentures:` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

